  {
   "id": "is.workflow.actions.comment",
   "p": {
    "WFCommentActionText": "Log-PageRender: a URL in, a rendered image of the page committed to shortcuts/shots/ in web-tools-private. Nothing is displayed and nothing is screenshotted, so there is no delay to race and no way for what is on screen to end up in the capture.\n\nCan run as URL:\nshortcuts://run-shortcut?name=Log-PageRender&input=text&text=<the page URL>\n\nGet Contents of Web Page loads the address, Make PDF renders it, and the first PDF page becomes the image. Whether that render runs the page's own JavaScript is the open question, and the committed image answers it: a page whose script never ran arrives showing its pre-script state. The page count rides in the log row, so a long page reports how much of itself is missing from a first-page-only capture."
   }
  },
